<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.510
Itsuki! Subaru!

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:24.310
Dammit!

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:31.290
This forest is haunted.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.590
No way. You can't scare me like...

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:34.980
Help.

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:37.820
Did you just...?

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:41.010
Help... me!

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.040
CHAPTER 56

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:50.020
THE BEWITCHING MELODY
ELITE THE VAMPIRE

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:51.520
Finger Guns!

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:57.530
Well done! Nice job, Kitaro!

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:02.030
The <i>yokai</i> Shokera is vanquished
and this town is at peace again.

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:05.910
Don't be so carefree.
This is all because you went and...

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:08.620
Now, now. Everyone makes mistakes.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:12.420
More importantly, we gotta
milk the client for a big reward.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:15.040
I already turned that down.

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:17.860
What?

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:19.840
What?!

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:22.890
What the hell! I found this case!

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:25.810
How can you be so soft
as to work for free?!

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:28.810
Calm down.
You'll only make yourself hungry.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:30.310
Let's go for some ramen.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:35.310
Screw ramen! I was planning on
steak at an expensive restaurant!

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:36.860
Good grief.

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:39.590
Don't worry. He's just being himself.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.540
Do you want French, Japanese,
or Chinese food?

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:46.830
Well...

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:49.350
Man. Hardly anything good.

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:53.750
Hey! You sewer rat!

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:56.250
This is all Kitaro's fault!

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.830
What an alluring melody.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:53.560
<i>Trés bien</i>, Rat Man-kun.

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:57.940
It seems our souls are
on the same wavelength after all.

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.020
Our souls?

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:02.780
I'm saying we're alike, you and I.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:07.740
We're geniuses at surviving
in this rotten world.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:10.530
You totally get me!

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:11.870
Who are you?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.040
Elite the vampire.

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:16.170
ELITE THE VAMPIRE

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:17.670
Vampire...?!

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:22.090
There's no need to fear.
I have a job offer for you.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:24.550
A job? For how much?

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.050
How about this much?

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:26.850
50,000 yen?!

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:29.470
No, no, no. You're two zeros off.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.810
F-Five million?! I'll do it!

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.890
Then let us dine to
celebrate our contract.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:38.400
Here it is.

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:42.230
So your son is being hunted by a vampire?

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:45.410
Yes. It was a week ago.

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:51.620
My only son, Touma, was found wounded
wandering in the woods at night.

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:54.500
He's been terrified
ever since returning home.

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:59.750
That night,
one of my roommates didn't return.

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:02.150
When we went looking for him...

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:14.080
We all ran.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:18.120
But, Itsuki and Subaru...

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.070
So, this vampire...?

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:31.570
He's the headmaster of the Poranchal
Academy that Touma entered in spring.

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:39.140
Delicious!
Truly blood-dripping, super rare!

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:40.920
<i>Trés bien.</i>

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.960
Would you like a glass?

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.420
Is that red wine?

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.300
No. It's fresh blood.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:48.920
N-No thank you.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:55.990
You know, you've got
a lot of pretty boys here.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:57.560
That's not all.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:02.020
They're super elites who will eventually
take on pivotal roles in this country.

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:16.040
I make them obedient slaves
and send them out into society.

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:23.090
They'll go on to infiltrate vital fields
like politics, law, education, and media,

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:25.540
and control this country.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.650
And I...

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:37.240
<i>Trés bien.</i>

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:43.020
By controlling them from the sidelines,
I will indirectly control this country.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:47.150
Wonderful! But will that really work?

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:54.070
I've already spent the last 1,000 years
controlling the world that way.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:58.660
By remaining hidden
and controlling humans from the shadows,

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:01.770
I've sewn chaos and revolt.

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:05.480
It's the ultimate self-satisfaction.

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:08.550
So what's my job?

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:14.050
True, it's hard to believe in vampires.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:17.220
But I believe my son's words.

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:20.430
Kitaro-san, please protect my son.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:21.690
I understand.

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:23.190
What? Kitaro?

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:27.400
Yes. Kitaro is trying to hinder my plans.

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.190
He must be removed.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:31.530
So... you'll kill him?

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:34.370
No, I won't be so barbaric.

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:37.200
I'll make him my obedient slave.

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:41.600
I understand. Leave it to me.

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:43.960
Wh-Who is it?!

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:48.460
It's me. I've brought Kitaro-san,
a <i>yokai</i> extermination expert.

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:52.720
A kid?

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.150
Don't worry.

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:58.640
Kitaro is sure to protect you
from the vampire.

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:01.220
We understand the situation.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.980
So it's a guard mission.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:05.110
Against a worthy opponent!

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:06.770
Stop talking big. I'll kiss you!

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:07.650
Whoosh!

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:08.940
Oh! It's here already!

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:10.380
It's the vampire!

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:13.860
Take this!

00:09:16.130 --> 00:09:17.780
You're goin' nowhere!

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:30.710
Rat Man?! What are you doing here?

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:33.460
You'll see in a moment.

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:38.700
What's this song?

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:43.370
I feel really good...

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:48.150
H-Hey, everyone!

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.500
What's wrong?

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:52.210
Perfect.

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:00.600
Th-This is...?

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:13.170
I control people with the sound of
my guitar. It's acoustic hypnosis.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:17.430
How magnificent!
Does it work on <i>yokai</i> as well?

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:18.720
Of course.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:24.410
However, with <i>yokai</i>, I must first
observe their characteristics.

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:28.980
Kitaro, Touma-kun's in danger!

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.580
Oh no you don't!

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:38.110
I'm here for you, Touma.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:48.690
Touma-kun!

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:55.220
He must be the vampire!

00:10:55.220 --> 00:11:01.260
That's the vampire world's super nobleman,
the great Elite-sensei!

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:03.930
Elite the vampire...

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.540
<i>Adieu</i>, Kitaro.

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:09.810
After him!

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:10.770
Rollo Cloth!

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:13.110
Cotton copies!

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:14.060
Me too!

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:21.570
ELITE THE VAMPIRE

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:26.080
ELITE THE VAMPIRE'S HOUSE

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:24.970
-<i>"Yeah, yeah. You're hot and cold."</i>
-<i>"Huh?!"</i>

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:25.970
<i>"What'd I do?</i>"

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:28.680
Cheers!

00:11:30.810 --> 00:11:32.310
Delicious!

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:38.930
Rat Man-kun, you called me
a "super nobleman", didn't you?

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:40.010
I did.

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:41.530
You're wrong.

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:44.220
My real name is Johnny.

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:48.190
I'm no elite.
I'm garbage in the vampire world.

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:50.810
Johnny? You must be joking!

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.440
It's true.

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:57.480
Vampires are generally nobles
with good bloodlines.

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:02.030
But I was the servant vampire bat
of a certain vampire in France.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:05.370
I drank the blood of beautiful women
and evolved into a <i>yokai</i>.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.790
I'm a creature of crude descent.

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:10.370
Despite any talents or abilities,

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:14.860
I was never accepted as first class
among the vampires.

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:17.630
Do you weep for me?

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:21.530
It's 'cause I... I know how you feel.

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:28.100
I've been looked down upon so much
because I'm a half-<i>yokai</i>.

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:32.860
You're the first I've ever told this to.

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:34.310
Why me?

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:37.560
I must have felt a sympathy between us.

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:38.940
Sympathy?

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:42.050
That's right,
I never paid you for the job.

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:45.700
A 500-yen coin?

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.700
It's all yours.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:51.040
Oh come on. You promised five million...

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.920
Who said that?

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:57.130
I merely said you were
two zeros off from 50,000 yen.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.130
Y-You tricked me?!

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:02.050
Stop it!

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:04.300
Didn't you feel a sympathy between us?!

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:07.510
I did. The first I've ever felt.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:12.310
But I trust no one.
That's how I've survived this long.

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:21.460
No one has fallen into that lake
and ever come up again.

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:28.970
Now, Kitaro should be here soon.

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:40.340
<i>Why do I have to die here?
Dammit! Treat me like a fool will you?!</i>

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:43.590
Calm down.
You'll only make yourself hungry.

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:48.660
<i>I know that. But even so,
the hungrier I get, the more I think...</i>

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:55.060
<i>"I swear I'll survive!"</i>

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:01.000
That's it!

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:03.900
They're coming!

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:05.990
-Kitaro-san!
-We've got this!

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:07.400
I'm counting on you!

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:13.990
This way!

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:21.150
Touma-kun!

00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:23.420
Are you okay?

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:25.920
I've been waiting, Kitaro.

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:27.420
Elite.

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:37.790
T-Touma-kun?!

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:40.600
H-He's so strong!

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:45.360
Surprised?

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:50.110
My acoustic hypnosis
not only controls people,

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:54.030
but draws out
their potential to its limit.

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:57.540
Kitaro, you've fallen into a trap.

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:01.880
Touma was bait. I let him escape
so you could protect him.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:05.380
Why did you go so far to get me?

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:09.970
You're the descendant of the Ghost Tribe.
An elite among elites.

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:14.390
And you help the humans.
You're insufferable!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.640
Kitaro, you are strong
and humans are weak.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:20.560
But what about against large groups?

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:24.440
This is how I've eliminated
those in my way.

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:25.900
Curse you!

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:29.130
Curse you! You lowly creature!

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:38.410
By thus being feared, I attained
the absolute position of elite <i>yokai</i>.

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:42.340
But, Kitaro, you defeated <i>yokai</i>
for the humans.

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:47.440
And of all things, you even
defeated Backbeard, saving this country.

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:51.680
I envied, no, I loathed you.

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:54.180
That's why, Kitaro, I shall defeat you,

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:59.430
proving I'm the true elite
to all the <i>yokai</i> in the world.

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:02.670
Dammit! Stop it, all of you!

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:07.880
Pesky little eyeball.

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:13.450
Now, let us finish this.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.700
Do you know what that is?

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:18.960
A mixture of hyena, condor,
and anaconda gastric juices,

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:22.380
with demon's blood to make
the most powerful dissolvent.

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:27.460
If injected, you'll melt completely.
Not even bones will remain.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:28.800
Don't...

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:33.720
Even with your extraordinary <i>yokai</i> power,
this is the end for you, Kitaro.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:35.590
Stop!

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:40.220
Kitaro!

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:45.110
Sorry we're late!

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:46.060
You okay?

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:52.530
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:55.740
Hair Needles!

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:00.450
Everyone...

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.830
I've seen them now, Kitaro...

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:05.330
Your characteristics.

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:16.430
That was disappointing, Kitaro.

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:17.590
Hold it!

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:22.730
Rat Man, you survived.

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:25.980
You can't kill Rat Man-sama so easily!

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:27.480
Take this!

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:31.980
Crap! I'm out of juice!

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.740
Dammit! You're not getting away with this!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:36.930
Kitaro.

00:17:42.430 --> 00:17:46.420
That's it, Kitaro.
Kill Rat Man by your hands.

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:47.860
Ow, ow, ow...

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:52.670
Whoa! Don't, Kitaro!

00:17:56.700 --> 00:18:00.600
Are you serious?!
I won't stand a chance against that!

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:02.180
Kitaro!

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:07.150
S-Sure, compared to you,
I'm nothing but trash.

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:09.400
But, even I...

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:11.940
Kitaro, kill him already!

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:17.700
Dammit! If you're gonna do it,
do it yourself, Johnny!

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:20.120
Kitaro! Do it!

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:49.480
Now I can't play the guitar anymore.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:52.630
My 1,000-year life ends here.

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:12.750
Elite! You...!

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:15.650
You're spreading fire yourself?!

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:21.470
Touma-kun.

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:23.600
Everyone, give me a hand!

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:24.640
Got it!

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:26.850
But, the exit...

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:29.960
Then how about this!

00:19:35.710 --> 00:19:38.190
C'mon. Hurry, y'all.

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:43.200
Impressive teamwork.
So those are your friends.

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:48.330
Tell me, Kitaro.
Why do you side with the humans?

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:51.630
It's no big reason. Just an old debt.

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:52.540
But,

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:57.800
I won't stand any <i>yokai</i> that eliminates
humans or human that eliminates <i>yokai</i>.

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:03.780
You truly are an insufferable one.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:09.730
What are you doing, Rat Man?

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:27.180
It's the true form of Elite the vampire.

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:41.530
Rat Man?

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:57.290
It's the end of Elite the vampire.

00:20:57.670 --> 00:20:58.650
No.

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:01.340
His name was Johnny.

00:21:02.930 --> 00:21:05.660
Johnny the vampire.

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:15.670
Ah, it's you.

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:17.750
I'm rather busy right now.

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:20.340
I've left your reward there. Take it.

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:21.930
No thank you.

00:21:21.930 --> 00:21:23.030
What?

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:29.430
"An insufferable one"...

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:38.230
Rat Man.

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:41.230
Wanna go for some ramen?

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:43.240
You're paying.

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:45.010
Sure.

00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:47.740
No way. You're broke after all.

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:49.370
I'll figure something out.

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:52.870
Something? Like run without paying?

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:54.630
Of course not.

00:21:54.630 --> 00:21:56.630
Then what'll you do?

00:21:56.630 --> 00:21:58.900
I'll figure it out.

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>You're a dream
My dream</i>

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>kimi wa yume boku no yume</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>I'm dreaming in a dream</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>yume no naka de yume miteiru</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>Let's stay like this forever</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>itsumade mo kono mama de imashou</i>

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.300
<i>You blur and begin to fade</i>

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.300
<i>kasuka kimi ga nijimu</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:35.020
<i>Don't you cry
Where did you come from?</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:35.020
<i>Don't you cry anata wa doko kara kitano?</i>

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>A masquerade
Faceless faces laugh</i>

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>kamenbutou kao no nai kao ga warau</i>

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>Hee-hee-hee</i>

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>fufufu</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>In dreams, in dreams
Lost in dreams</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>yume ni yume ni yume ni samayoi</i>

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:48.160
<i>Twirling around</i>

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:48.160
<i>kuru kuru to mawaru</i>

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:52.490
<i>Everyone dancing, dancing
Looking for love</i>

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:52.490
<i>dare mo odoru odoru ai wo sagashite</i>

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:59.330
<i>RONDO, spin, spin
Dream, dream</i>

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:59.330
<i>RONDO mawareyo maware yume yume</i>

00:23:01.460 --> 00:23:04.840
<i>Serial vampiric incidents</i>
<i>by a Western </i>yokai<i>.</i>

00:23:04.960 --> 00:23:07.260
<i>Dad, just what is...?!</i>

00:23:07.380 --> 00:23:09.720
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:09.840 --> 00:23:12.350
<i>"The Bloody Noble
La Siene"</i>

00:23:12.470 --> 00:23:15.180
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
